The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/apple-watch-series-12-announced-all-day-hr-sensor/">Apple Watch Series 12</a> is now available, three years after the Series 9. In that time, Apple has introduced a thinner design, larger displays, faster charging, new water sensors, and a substantially more capable health sensing system. Is that enough to justify replacing a Series 9?<br/>
